      en: ["Niumi National Park was officially gazetted as a protected area in 1986.", "It covers a total land and water area of approximately 49.4 square kilometers.", "The park has been a designated Ramsar Wetland site since 2008.", "It forms the southern part of the transboundary Sine-Saloum Delta.", "The West African Manatee is known to inhabit the park's lagoon systems.", "The mangrove networks are vital nursery grounds for the regional fishing industry."],
